       "url": "https://sites.math.washington.edu/~billey/classes/reflection.groups/references/EntireBook.pdf",
       "locator": "Section 3.1, printed pp. 65-66: the right and left weak orders defined by length-increasing chains of simple generators, and the basic relation with Bruhat order (the weak orders refine Bruhat order); neither the lattice property of Section 3.2 nor the word property of Section 3.3 is used here"
      },
