       "url": "https://gtbarkley.org/cmnd/Lecture3Notes.pdf",
       "locator": "Lecture 3, printed p. 1: the remark that $u\\le_R v$ (weak order) implies $u\\le v$ (Bruhat order), with the contrast 'there are usually more relations in Bruhat order', and the $S_3$ comparison table"
      }
     ]
